ard. (seed based)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Daily seed: compete to reach as high as possible in a mode that changes seed once every 24hr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/0f949a8329bdf857f7506cfe7b8c3de2.poster.avif?t=1744466045\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/0f949a8329bdf857f7506cfe7b8c3de2.webm?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/0f949a8329bdf857f7506cfe7b8c3de2.mp4?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good place to learn how to learn how the game works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress up your character as you go:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/8657244ff295a176e010a56c1df2ea44.poster.avif?t=1744466045\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/8657244ff295a176e010a56c1df2ea44.webm?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/8657244ff295a176e010a56c1df2ea44.mp4?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your favorite character skin as you get more money:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also many different bomb types you can choose between!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/f2fa55a12fcc63db6451aa87e42274dc.poster.avif?t=1744466045\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/f2fa55a12fcc63db6451aa87e42274dc.webm?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/f2fa55a12fcc63db6451aa87e42274dc.mp4?t=1744466045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
